Board-only suite: its programs map real STM32L476RG devices, which every OS-hosted emitter rejects (E2220), so the host integrate run skips this directory, and the ESP32-S3_raw board run skips it too (ESP32-S3_raw.skip: the windows are the Nucleo's). Run it with make integrate TRIAL_TARGET=STM32-L476RG_raw TRIAL_SUITES=device_actor_stm32_addition from trials/. Remove this file only if a host-side skip mechanism replaces it (see README.md).
